    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34026" root="فصى" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصًى</span></b> , (M, K, * TA,) incorrectly written in the
copies of the K with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span> (TA,) The <i>stones</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبّ</span>) <i>of
raisins:</i> (M, K:) also mentioned in the K [and
M] as with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ض</span>: (TA:) n. un. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">(??)</span>: (M, K:)
of the dial. of El-Hijáz: and they also call the
<i>stones of dates</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فصية</span> [app. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">(??)</span>, pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصى</span>, like
as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِتْيَةٌ</span> is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَتًى</span>]. (TA.)

